  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，我说，秦始皇陵连前三都进不去，好多朋友在评论区不服，别急，今天您听完就明白了，他确实进不了前三，但他的邪乎劲儿一点不比前三。差。第十道第六，北宋皇陵藏在麦田里西夏王陵不长草不落鸟汉阳陵，埋着几十万缩微陶俑唐昭陵两百个，老兄弟守着明定陵零三千件文物挖出来又送回去。今天这集就是第五到第一，一个比一个悬。最后那个全世界找了一百年，连影子都没见着。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第五名，陕西咸阳、汉武帝、茂陵、汉武帝刘彻的陵，汉朝皇帝里陵修的最大的一座陵修了五十三年。汉武帝当了多少年，皇皇帝就修了多少年，您知道里面埋了多少东西吗？史书上写着，到汉武帝下葬的时候，地宫里的陪葬品已经多到不负容物，就是塞不下了金银珠宝、丝绸、酒具，还有活的飞禽走兽，专门有人养着等着殉葬。茂陵旁边还埋着卫青、霍去病、霍光这些大汉名将名臣一座陵，把整个汉武盛世全埋进去了。第四名，陕西西安秦始皇陵这陵最绝的不是大，是不敢挖兵马俑，只是他陵园的一个角落。整个林区五十六平方公里，相当于七十八个故宫地宫里头。史书上写着以水银为百川江河大海上句天文下句地理什么意思？用水银灌成江河湖海顶上，画着天门星象底下，铺着山川地里，秦始皇躺在中间，天文地理全踩在脚下考古队。用物探技术测过风土堆的汞含量是周围土壤的七十多倍。水银的记载是真的，为什么不挖？第一，技术不行，兵马俑挖出来的时候是彩色的，一接触空气几分钟，颜色就掉了，变成了灰扑扑的泥人地，宫里的东西只会更脆弱。第二，水银有毒拱蒸汽人进去就是送死。第三，挖了就保护不了兵马俑坑，到现在还是挖一半，留一半，不敢全打开，一座陵埋了两千两，百年全世界都知道，他在哪，就是不敢动。您说这是胆小还是敬畏？第三名，陕西礼泉，唐乾陵、武则天和唐高宗李治的合葬礼。这灵最绝的就一个字，挖不动，怎么修的呢？把整座梁山掏空了墓道口，用两千五百多条石条封死，每块石条上凿了凹槽，用铁板卡住，然后灌铁水，整个墓道成了一条铁柱的通道。唐朝末年，黄巢起义带了四十万大军，在梁山挖了几个月，挖了一条四十米深的沟，现在还在叫黄巢沟，连墓道口都没找着。五代时候，盗墓贼温韬把唐朝十七座皇陵全挖了，唯独乾陵他带着人马去了。刚到山脚下狂风暴雨，电闪雷鸣人马一撤天，就晴了试了三次，三次都这样。后来民国军阀孙连仲用炸药炸炸开了，外面几层进去一看，铁水浇死的通道根本炸不开，最后也撤了一座陵，一千三百多年四十万人没挖洞，三次天变三次退兵。您说这是防盗还是天意？第二名，内蒙古鄂尔多斯成吉思汗陵。注意，这个陵是衣冠冢，真正的成吉思汗葬在哪儿？没人知道怎么葬的呢？蒙古密史里记载了一个习俗，叫秘葬，人死了挖一条深沟，把遗体放进去，然后用万马踏平不留坟头。等到第二年草长出来了，跟周围一模一样，根本看不出来下葬的时候，当着母骆驼的面把小骆驼杀了母骆驼。记住这个地方以后，祭祀牵着母骆驼来，他在哪儿停下哀鸣，就在那儿记登姆骆驼死了，谁也找不到。全世界考古队找了一百多年，蒙古国找过贺兰山，找过六盘山，找过阿尔泰山，找过连卫星遥感都用上了，到现在连一块砖都没找着。一个征服了半个世界的帝王。死后连坟头都找不到，您说这是低调还是最高明的防道？第一名，陕西延安黄帝陵等等。黄帝陵不是帝王陵吗？对，但他跟前面九座都不一样。前面九座埋的是皇帝，是王皇帝陵，埋的是咱们所有人的老祖宗。司马迁的史记第一篇武帝本纪，第一个写的就是皇帝。从汉武帝开始，历代皇帝登基了，要来记打仗了，要来记。武朝换代了清皇帝第一件事还是来记，一直记到。今天两千多，当年没断过。每年清明国家功绩，海内外华人几万人聚在桥山脚下，皇帝手执摆，传说是皇帝亲手种的，五千多年了，还活着，七个人合抱都抱不过来。您想想，前面九座陵埋的是金银珠宝，是水银，江河，是铁水封门。皇帝陵埋的是什么？是中国人的根，是每个中国人走到哪儿都忘不了的那个老家，别的灵，再牛都是一个人的黄帝陵，是所有人的，您听出来了没有？这十座帝王陵没有一座是光靠大出名的北宋皇陵，靠的是通透。西夏王陵靠的是不长草，汉阳陵靠的是缩威。人间唐昭陵，靠的是老兄弟。明定陵，靠的是教训。茂陵靠的是塞不下，秦始皇陵，靠的是不敢挖。乾陵靠的是挖不动成吉思汗陵，靠的是找不着皇帝陵，靠的是所有人都认，您发现没有这些灵厉害的地方，不在于埋了多少宝贝，在于每一座都藏着一段中国人自己的故事，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00002",
      "start_ms": 590,
      "end_ms": 990,
      "text": "我说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1030,
      "end_ms": 3390,
      "text": "秦始皇陵连前三都进不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3810,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "text": "好多朋友在评论区不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6170,
      "end_ms": 6690,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6990,
      "end_ms": 8770,
      "text": "今天您听完就明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9310,
      "end_ms": 11350,
      "text": "他确实进不了前三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11730,
      "end_ms": 14890,
      "text": "但他的邪乎劲儿一点不比前三。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14890,
      "end_ms": 15130,
      "text": "差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15550,
      "end_ms": 16490,
      "text": "第十道第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17250,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "北宋皇陵藏在麦田里西夏王陵不长草不落鸟汉阳陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23330,
      "end_ms": 28030,
      "text": "埋着几十万缩微陶俑唐昭陵两百个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28030,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "老兄弟守着明定陵零三千件文物挖出来又送回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32760,
      "end_ms": 34720,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35160,
      "end_ms": 36180,
      "text": "一个比一个悬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "最后那个全世界找了一百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38920,
      "end_ms": 40280,
      "text": "连影子都没见着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40620,
      "end_ms": 41240,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 42320,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42780,
      "end_ms": 44760,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00021",
      "start_ms": 45080,
      "end_ms": 46460,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46460,
      "end_ms": 48540,
      "text": "在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00023",
      "start_ms": 49020,
      "end_ms": 52480,
      "text": "陕西咸阳、汉武帝、茂陵、汉武帝刘彻的陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00024",
      "start_ms": 52880,
      "end_ms": 58120,
      "text": "汉朝皇帝里陵修的最大的一座陵修了五十三年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00025",
      "start_ms": 58500,
      "end_ms": 59760,
      "text": "汉武帝当了多少年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00026",
      "start_ms": 59760,
      "end_ms": 61615,
      "text": "皇皇帝就修了多少年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00027",
      "start_ms": 62240,
      "end_ms": 64245,
      "text": "您知道里面埋了多少东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00028",
      "start_ms": 65220,
      "end_ms": 66315,
      "text": "史书上写着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00029",
      "start_ms": 66610,
      "end_ms": 68365,
      "text": "到汉武帝下葬的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00030",
      "start_ms": 69010,
      "end_ms": 72760,
      "text": "地宫里的陪葬品已经多到不负容物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00031",
      "start_ms": 72940,
      "end_ms": 77025,
      "text": "就是塞不下了金银珠宝、丝绸、酒具，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77310,
      "end_ms": 79085,
      "text": "还有活的飞禽走兽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79450,
      "end_ms": 81935,
      "text": "专门有人养着等着殉葬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82410,
      "end_ms": 89875,
      "text": "茂陵旁边还埋着卫青、霍去病、霍光这些大汉名将名臣一座陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90320,
      "end_ms": 93135,
      "text": "把整个汉武盛世全埋进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00036",
      "start_ms": 94210,
      "end_ms": 94905,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95300,
      "end_ms": 99560,
      "text": "陕西西安秦始皇陵这陵最绝的不是大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00038",
      "start_ms": 99700,
      "end_ms": 101560,
      "text": "是不敢挖兵马俑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101840,
      "end_ms": 104155,
      "text": "只是他陵园的一个角落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104480,
      "end_ms": 107115,
      "text": "整个林区五十六平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00041",
      "start_ms": 107490,
      "end_ms": 110105,
      "text": "相当于七十八个故宫地宫里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110380,
      "end_ms": 118725,
      "text": "史书上写着以水银为百川江河大海上句天文下句地理什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119300,
      "end_ms": 122710,
      "text": "用水银灌成江河湖海顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122890,
      "end_ms": 125390,
      "text": "画着天门星象底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00045",
      "start_ms": 125390,
      "end_ms": 126465,
      "text": "铺着山川地里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126920,
      "end_ms": 128405,
      "text": "秦始皇躺在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00047",
      "start_ms": 128840,
      "end_ms": 132120,
      "text": "天文地理全踩在脚下考古队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00048",
      "start_ms": 132120,
      "end_ms": 138055,
      "text": "用物探技术测过风土堆的汞含量是周围土壤的七十多倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00049",
      "start_ms": 138480,
      "end_ms": 140565,
      "text": "水银的记载是真的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00050",
      "start_ms": 140800,
      "end_ms": 141755,
      "text": "为什么不挖？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00051",
      "start_ms": 142290,
      "end_ms": 142670,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143210,
      "end_ms": 144115,
      "text": "技术不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00053",
      "start_ms": 145020,
      "end_ms": 148055,
      "text": "兵马俑挖出来的时候是彩色的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148250,
      "end_ms": 150405,
      "text": "一接触空气几分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00055",
      "start_ms": 150730,
      "end_ms": 151695,
      "text": "颜色就掉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152060,
      "end_ms": 154640,
      "text": "变成了灰扑扑的泥人地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00057",
      "start_ms": 154640,
      "end_ms": 157025,
      "text": "宫里的东西只会更脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00058",
      "start_ms": 157370,
      "end_ms": 157725,
      "text": "第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00059",
      "start_ms": 158070,
      "end_ms": 162325,
      "text": "水银有毒拱蒸汽人进去就是送死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00060",
      "start_ms": 162950,
      "end_ms": 163370,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00061",
      "start_ms": 163670,
      "end_ms": 166335,
      "text": "挖了就保护不了兵马俑坑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00062",
      "start_ms": 166870,
      "end_ms": 168790,
      "text": "到现在还是挖一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00063",
      "start_ms": 168790,
      "end_ms": 169310,
      "text": "留一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00064",
      "start_ms": 169390,
      "end_ms": 170515,
      "text": "不敢全打开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00065",
      "start_ms": 170980,
      "end_ms": 173450,
      "text": "一座陵埋了两千两，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00066",
      "start_ms": 173450,
      "end_ms": 175930,
      "text": "百年全世界都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175930,
      "end_ms": 176535,
      "text": "他在哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00068",
      "start_ms": 177240,
      "end_ms": 178105,
      "text": "就是不敢动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00069",
      "start_ms": 179120,
      "end_ms": 181385,
      "text": "您说这是胆小还是敬畏？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00070",
      "start_ms": 182400,
      "end_ms": 183005,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00071",
      "start_ms": 184140,
      "end_ms": 185300,
      "text": "陕西礼泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00072",
      "start_ms": 185560,
      "end_ms": 189085,
      "text": "唐乾陵、武则天和唐高宗李治的合葬礼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00073",
      "start_ms": 189540,
      "end_ms": 191875,
      "text": "这灵最绝的就一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00074",
      "start_ms": 192170,
      "end_ms": 192685,
      "text": "挖不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00075",
      "start_ms": 193220,
      "end_ms": 194105,
      "text": "怎么修的呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00076",
      "start_ms": 194400,
      "end_ms": 197220,
      "text": "把整座梁山掏空了墓道口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00077",
      "start_ms": 197220,
      "end_ms": 199685,
      "text": "用两千五百多条石条封死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00078",
      "start_ms": 200400,
      "end_ms": 202275,
      "text": "每块石条上凿了凹槽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00079",
      "start_ms": 202690,
      "end_ms": 203955,
      "text": "用铁板卡住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00080",
      "start_ms": 204320,
      "end_ms": 205255,
      "text": "然后灌铁水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00081",
      "start_ms": 205740,
      "end_ms": 208885,
      "text": "整个墓道成了一条铁柱的通道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00082",
      "start_ms": 209690,
      "end_ms": 210675,
      "text": "唐朝末年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00083",
      "start_ms": 211030,
      "end_ms": 214195,
      "text": "黄巢起义带了四十万大军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00084",
      "start_ms": 214740,
      "end_ms": 216255,
      "text": "在梁山挖了几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00085",
      "start_ms": 216590,
      "end_ms": 218365,
      "text": "挖了一条四十米深的沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00086",
      "start_ms": 218710,
      "end_ms": 220565,
      "text": "现在还在叫黄巢沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00087",
      "start_ms": 220970,
      "end_ms": 222410,
      "text": "连墓道口都没找着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00088",
      "start_ms": 222490,
      "end_ms": 223230,
      "text": "五代时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00089",
      "start_ms": 223430,
      "end_ms": 227645,
      "text": "盗墓贼温韬把唐朝十七座皇陵全挖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00090",
      "start_ms": 228030,
      "end_ms": 230595,
      "text": "唯独乾陵他带着人马去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00091",
      "start_ms": 231440,
      "end_ms": 233620,
      "text": "刚到山脚下狂风暴雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00092",
      "start_ms": 233720,
      "end_ms": 236250,
      "text": "电闪雷鸣人马一撤天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00093",
      "start_ms": 236270,
      "end_ms": 238205,
      "text": "就晴了试了三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00094",
      "start_ms": 238730,
      "end_ms": 239625,
      "text": "三次都这样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00095",
      "start_ms": 240090,
      "end_ms": 244750,
      "text": "后来民国军阀孙连仲用炸药炸炸开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00096",
      "start_ms": 244750,
      "end_ms": 246810,
      "text": "外面几层进去一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00097",
      "start_ms": 247030,
      "end_ms": 249850,
      "text": "铁水浇死的通道根本炸不开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00098",
      "start_ms": 250410,
      "end_ms": 252550,
      "text": "最后也撤了一座陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00099",
      "start_ms": 252850,
      "end_ms": 256910,
      "text": "一千三百多年四十万人没挖洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00100",
      "start_ms": 256950,
      "end_ms": 259250,
      "text": "三次天变三次退兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00101",
      "start_ms": 259350,
      "end_ms": 261530,
      "text": "您说这是防盗还是天意？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00102",
      "start_ms": 262510,
      "end_ms": 263070,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00103",
      "start_ms": 263330,
      "end_ms": 265950,
      "text": "内蒙古鄂尔多斯成吉思汗陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00104",
      "start_ms": 266790,
      "end_ms": 267210,
      "text": "注意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00105",
      "start_ms": 267450,
      "end_ms": 269330,
      "text": "这个陵是衣冠冢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00106",
      "start_ms": 270670,
      "end_ms": 272930,
      "text": "真正的成吉思汗葬在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00107",
      "start_ms": 272930,
      "end_ms": 275370,
      "text": "没人知道怎么葬的呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00108",
      "start_ms": 275370,
      "end_ms": 277630,
      "text": "蒙古密史里记载了一个习俗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00109",
      "start_ms": 277670,
      "end_ms": 278870,
      "text": "叫秘葬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00110",
      "start_ms": 278910,
      "end_ms": 280650,
      "text": "人死了挖一条深沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00111",
      "start_ms": 280950,
      "end_ms": 282210,
      "text": "把遗体放进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00112",
      "start_ms": 282470,
      "end_ms": 285030,
      "text": "然后用万马踏平不留坟头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00113",
      "start_ms": 285350,
      "end_ms": 287770,
      "text": "等到第二年草长出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287770,
      "end_ms": 289030,
      "text": "跟周围一模一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00115",
      "start_ms": 289090,
      "end_ms": 291410,
      "text": "根本看不出来下葬的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00116",
      "start_ms": 291610,
      "end_ms": 295550,
      "text": "当着母骆驼的面把小骆驼杀了母骆驼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00117",
      "start_ms": 295550,
      "end_ms": 297330,
      "text": "记住这个地方以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00118",
      "start_ms": 297350,
      "end_ms": 300175,
      "text": "祭祀牵着母骆驼来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00119",
      "start_ms": 300460,
      "end_ms": 302075,
      "text": "他在哪儿停下哀鸣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00120",
      "start_ms": 303010,
      "end_ms": 306090,
      "text": "就在那儿记登姆骆驼死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00121",
      "start_ms": 306290,
      "end_ms": 307185,
      "text": "谁也找不到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00122",
      "start_ms": 307820,
      "end_ms": 310000,
      "text": "全世界考古队找了一百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00123",
      "start_ms": 310300,
      "end_ms": 312340,
      "text": "蒙古国找过贺兰山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00124",
      "start_ms": 312360,
      "end_ms": 313800,
      "text": "找过六盘山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00125",
      "start_ms": 313800,
      "end_ms": 315220,
      "text": "找过阿尔泰山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00126",
      "start_ms": 315240,
      "end_ms": 318140,
      "text": "找过连卫星遥感都用上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00127",
      "start_ms": 318660,
      "end_ms": 321260,
      "text": "到现在连一块砖都没找着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00128",
      "start_ms": 321760,
      "end_ms": 324240,
      "text": "一个征服了半个世界的帝王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00129",
      "start_ms": 324580,
      "end_ms": 326580,
      "text": "死后连坟头都找不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00130",
      "start_ms": 327340,
      "end_ms": 330700,
      "text": "您说这是低调还是最高明的防道？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00131",
      "start_ms": 330840,
      "end_ms": 331360,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00132",
      "start_ms": 331700,
      "end_ms": 334300,
      "text": "陕西延安黄帝陵等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00133",
      "start_ms": 334720,
      "end_ms": 336520,
      "text": "黄帝陵不是帝王陵吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00134",
      "start_ms": 336680,
      "end_ms": 336920,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00135",
      "start_ms": 337570,
      "end_ms": 339710,
      "text": "但他跟前面九座都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00136",
      "start_ms": 340130,
      "end_ms": 342410,
      "text": "前面九座埋的是皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00137",
      "start_ms": 342590,
      "end_ms": 344150,
      "text": "是王皇帝陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00138",
      "start_ms": 344670,
      "end_ms": 347130,
      "text": "埋的是咱们所有人的老祖宗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00139",
      "start_ms": 347530,
      "end_ms": 350910,
      "text": "司马迁的史记第一篇武帝本纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00140",
      "start_ms": 351270,
      "end_ms": 353110,
      "text": "第一个写的就是皇帝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00141",
      "start_ms": 353649,
      "end_ms": 354910,
      "text": "从汉武帝开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00142",
      "start_ms": 355270,
      "end_ms": 356950,
      "text": "历代皇帝登基了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00143",
      "start_ms": 357390,
      "end_ms": 359050,
      "text": "要来记打仗了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00144",
      "start_ms": 359230,
      "end_ms": 359890,
      "text": "要来记。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00145",
      "start_ms": 360810,
      "end_ms": 364730,
      "text": "武朝换代了清皇帝第一件事还是来记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00146",
      "start_ms": 365050,
      "end_ms": 365910,
      "text": "一直记到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00147",
      "start_ms": 365910,
      "end_ms": 367330,
      "text": "今天两千多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00148",
      "start_ms": 367560,
      "end_ms": 368900,
      "text": "当年没断过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00149",
      "start_ms": 369060,
      "end_ms": 371325,
      "text": "每年清明国家功绩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00150",
      "start_ms": 371750,
      "end_ms": 375635,
      "text": "海内外华人几万人聚在桥山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00151",
      "start_ms": 376250,
      "end_ms": 377615,
      "text": "皇帝手执摆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00152",
      "start_ms": 378280,
      "end_ms": 380955,
      "text": "传说是皇帝亲手种的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00153",
      "start_ms": 381200,
      "end_ms": 382255,
      "text": "五千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00154",
      "start_ms": 382630,
      "end_ms": 383295,
      "text": "还活着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00155",
      "start_ms": 383650,
      "end_ms": 385615,
      "text": "七个人合抱都抱不过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00156",
      "start_ms": 386020,
      "end_ms": 386755,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00157",
      "start_ms": 387240,
      "end_ms": 390485,
      "text": "前面九座陵埋的是金银珠宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00158",
      "start_ms": 390750,
      "end_ms": 391450,
      "text": "是水银，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00159",
      "start_ms": 391550,
      "end_ms": 392215,
      "text": "江河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00160",
      "start_ms": 392670,
      "end_ms": 394225,
      "text": "是铁水封门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00161",
      "start_ms": 394600,
      "end_ms": 396775,
      "text": "皇帝陵埋的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00162",
      "start_ms": 397220,
      "end_ms": 398320,
      "text": "是中国人的根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00163",
      "start_ms": 398600,
      "end_ms": 402505,
      "text": "是每个中国人走到哪儿都忘不了的那个老家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00164",
      "start_ms": 402920,
      "end_ms": 403500,
      "text": "别的灵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00165",
      "start_ms": 403720,
      "end_ms": 406655,
      "text": "再牛都是一个人的黄帝陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00166",
      "start_ms": 407640,
      "end_ms": 408665,
      "text": "是所有人的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00167",
      "start_ms": 410090,
      "end_ms": 411225,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00168",
      "start_ms": 411500,
      "end_ms": 418210,
      "text": "这十座帝王陵没有一座是光靠大出名的北宋皇陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00169",
      "start_ms": 418490,
      "end_ms": 419545,
      "text": "靠的是通透。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00170",
      "start_ms": 420140,
      "end_ms": 422035,
      "text": "西夏王陵靠的是不长草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00171",
      "start_ms": 422530,
      "end_ms": 424350,
      "text": "汉阳陵靠的是缩威。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00172",
      "start_ms": 424350,
      "end_ms": 426150,
      "text": "人间唐昭陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00173",
      "start_ms": 426150,
      "end_ms": 427195,
      "text": "靠的是老兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00174",
      "start_ms": 427530,
      "end_ms": 428170,
      "text": "明定陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00175",
      "start_ms": 428170,
      "end_ms": 429045,
      "text": "靠的是教训。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00176",
      "start_ms": 429680,
      "end_ms": 431255,
      "text": "茂陵靠的是塞不下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00177",
      "start_ms": 431750,
      "end_ms": 432770,
      "text": "秦始皇陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00178",
      "start_ms": 432790,
      "end_ms": 433865,
      "text": "靠的是不敢挖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00179",
      "start_ms": 434340,
      "end_ms": 437640,
      "text": "乾陵靠的是挖不动成吉思汗陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00180",
      "start_ms": 437640,
      "end_ms": 440360,
      "text": "靠的是找不着皇帝陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00181",
      "start_ms": 440360,
      "end_ms": 443530,
      "text": "靠的是所有人都认，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00182",
      "start_ms": 443610,
      "end_ms": 447285,
      "text": "您发现没有这些灵厉害的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00183",
      "start_ms": 447660,
      "end_ms": 449405,
      "text": "不在于埋了多少宝贝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00184",
      "start_ms": 450110,
      "end_ms": 456035,
      "text": "在于每一座都藏着一段中国人自己的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00185",
      "start_ms": 456820,
      "end_ms": 457540,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_87049fb430a5dbb6_s00186",
      "start_ms": 457760,
      "end_ms": 459555,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
